    {
        "content": "<p>AFAIK synthesis matches syntactically and will only unfold <code>abbrev</code>s, so my guess would be that the first synth has <code>.r</code> which matches with your instance, but the others don't.<br>\nBut running your example in the playground, all 3 synths work, so what's the issue? Does it fail locally?</p>",
